\section{Choose an interface}{

For project execution use \code{\link[=appusage_config]{appusage_config()}}, \code{\link[=run_appusage_workflow]{run_appusage_workflow()}} and
\code{\link[=run_appusage_projects]{run_appusage_projects()}}. \code{\link[=run_appusage_project_workflow]{run_appusage_project_workflow()}} adds the
Wenjuanxing folder/workbook adapter. \link{appusage_configuration} owns the full
parameter reference; \link{appusage_demo} owns the teaching data description.

For one source use \code{\link[=run_first_level_appusage]{run_first_level_appusage()}} and
\code{\link[=run_second_level_appusage]{run_second_level_appusage()}}. Lower-level \code{\link[=parse_line]{parse_line()}}, \code{\link[=parse_meta]{parse_meta()}},
\code{\link[=parse_day]{parse_day()}} and \code{\link[=parse_app]{parse_app()}} expose native structures.
\code{\link[=assess_appusage_qc]{assess_appusage_qc()}} evaluates complete QC; \code{\link[=run_qc_appusage]{run_qc_appusage()}} in-memory
compatibility mode evaluates coverage. \code{\link[=audit_appusage_days]{audit_appusage_days()}} and
\code{\link[=audit_appusage_overlap]{audit_appusage_overlap()}} return explicit diagnostic views.

For existing caches use \code{\link[=plan_appusage_workflow]{plan_appusage_workflow()}}, \code{\link[=run_appusage_stage]{run_appusage_stage()}},
\code{\link[=update_app_categories_cache]{update_app_categories_cache()}} and \code{\link[=validate_appusage_project]{validate_appusage_project()}}. For explicit
